---Create a trail
---
---Creates a trail, allocating its per-repository number. Repo-level descriptions are not supported; legacy body fields are ignored. Use the project Trail body instead. status defaults to open and may be open or closed; draft is not supported, and merged is not a creatable status (400) — a trail only becomes merged through the merge endpoint. Asking for a branch that another trail already claims returns that conflict rather than a duplicate. A branch_name is required. The branch must be created successfully or, with branch_action=link, already exist; failed branch preparation never creates an unlinked trail.
---
---`POST /api/v1/trails/{host}/{owner}/{repo}`
