---Update a trail's metadata
---
---Updates trail metadata. status moves between open and closed (including reopening), but never to draft or merged: merging is executed by the merge endpoint, and asking for status=merged here is refused with 422 and writes nothing — as is any status change on an already-merged trail, whose other metadata stays editable. Repo trail body updates are not supported. Optionally conditional: send If-Match with the trail's ETag and a concurrent change is rejected with 412 instead of silently overwritten.
---
